<title>CHILE: Codelco names Cussen as new financial chief.</title>
<headline>Codelco names Cussen as new financial chief.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Codelco named businessman Albert Cussen Mackenna as its new vice president for adminstration and finance, the Chilean state copper company said.</p>
<p>The appointment was made by Codelco President Marcos Lima, who held the post until September.</p>
<p>Cussen, a civil engineer, was until now general manager of Empresas CB, parent company for financial and insurance conglomerate Cruz Blanca, and before that was general manager of pension fund Provida.</p>
<p>--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211</p>
